<title>HONG KONG: Sino Land interim net rises 49 pct.</title>
<headline>Sino Land interim net rises 49 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   28     vs  20.8</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    10.0   vs  8.0</p>
<p>    Net			    764.6  vs  512.12</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Turnover		   1,453.27 vs  1,072.04</p>
<p>    Company name		 Sino Land Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  April 16-25</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   May 26</p>
